# Psychic Venom triggers when Icy Manipulator taps the enchanted land, not only when it taps for mana.
[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Sapphire
Mox Pearl
Icy Manipulator
Psychic Venom
Island x20
[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20
[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Blue)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Icy Manipulator.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Island.Play
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Psychic Venom.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Island)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Icy Manipulator.Activate(Bot2.Battlefield.Island)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[Expect]
Bot2.Battlefield.Island.Tapped = true
Bot1.Life = 20
Bot2.Life = 18
